# Algorithms tdns-signer links an implementation for.
#
# Identical to cmdv2/auth/algs.list, and must stay that way: a bump-on-the-wire
# signer is the component actually producing the RRSIGs, so any algorithm the
# authoritative server can be configured to sign with, this must be able to
# sign with. A shorter list here fails at zone-load time on a policy naming a
# missing algorithm, which is a confusing way to discover a build-config
# mismatch.
#
# One registry NAME per line (see dnssec-algorithms/registry/registry.go).
# genalgs resolves each name to its codepoint, caps, package, and lib group,
# checks the lib is installed, and emits registered_algs.go + metadata_algs.go.
# Pure-Go (no lib needed):
MLDSA44
MLDSA65
MLDSA87
SLHDSA128S
# liboqs-backed:
FALCON512
FALCON1024
MAYO1
MAYO2
MAYO3
MAYO5
SNOVA24_5_4
SNOVA37_17_2
SNOVA25_8_3
CROSSRSDPG128SMALL
# SQIsign reference lib:
SQISIGN1
# QR-UOV reference lib:
QRUOV_Q31_L3
